<p>Commune with nature, removing the infusion saturation effect and reducing the cooldown of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> infusions by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> turns.</p>